# Claude Code — personal files (never committed)
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/logs/
.claude/.tool-counter
CLAUDE.local.md

# Dialog archive — raw JSONL stays local (privacy).
# .gitkeep and README.md inside .claude/dialogs/ are tracked.
.claude/dialogs/*.jsonl
.claude/dialogs/INDEX.md

